                "metadata": {
                    "note": "marketplace",
                    "author": "Kelli Welli",
                    "category": "music",
                    "description": "Can you say, \"Ooh La La Too Doo Na Na Oop Bop Oop Bop Ribbit\" ten times fast? The title may be silly, but it's taken right out of this set of silly, funny, sometimes sweet and very genuine set of songs -- each sound in the title is found within the songs, giving kids and grownups easy parts to listen for and sing along with. This album is filled with stories and sounds and calls for movement, as well as lovely lullabies for snuggle time. Includes John Lennon Songwriting Contest Grand Prize winning song: \"Turtlurtlurtle\"",
